flowchart TB
  CLI[CLI] --> GRAPH[LangGraph orchestration]
  WEB[Local Vinext console] --> API[Loopback web API]
  API --> GRAPH
  GRAPH -. non-sensitive stage progress .-> API
  GRAPH --> AUTH[Control plane authorization]
  AUTH -->|deny: safe reason only| DENIED[Denied result]
  AUTH -->|allow| CAPS[Purpose-specific capabilities]

  CAPS --> CHANGE[Source fingerprint check]
  CHANGE -->|changed| INGEST[Evidence ingestion]
  CHANGE -->|unchanged| EDB
  INGEST --> EDB[(SQLite evidence + FTS5 index)]
  EDB --> FILTER[SQL metadata and sensitivity filters]
  FILTER --> RANK[FTS5 BM25 ranking + authorized context fill]
  RANK --> BUNDLES[Capability-bound bundles]
  BUNDLES --> GUARD[Pre-generation authorization guard]

  GUARD --> FANOUT[Concurrent required-analyst fan-out]
  FANOUT --> CA[Commercial Analyst]
  FANOUT --> BA[Buyer Signal Analyst]
  FANOUT --> RA[Risk and Approval Analyst]
  CA --> CV[Analyst citation validation]
  BA --> CV
  RA --> CV
  CV -->|all three valid| NS[Negotiation Strategy Agent]
  CV -->|any required analyst fails| FAILED[Failed result; no brief]
  NS --> SV[Strategy citation and grounding validation]
  SV --> ASSEMBLE[Deterministic nine-section Brief Assembler]
  ASSEMBLE --> FV[Final citation and grounding validation]
  FV --> POLICY[Deterministic Deal Desk policy]

  CA --> MG[ModelGateway]
  BA --> MG
  RA --> MG
  NS --> MG
  MG --> LITE[LiteLLM proxy]

  POLICY -->|no gate| ALLOWED[Allowed internal brief]
  POLICY -->|high impact or uncertainty| APPROVAL[Human approval request]
  APPROVAL --> HUMAN[Authorized human reviewer]
  HUMAN --> DECISIONS[(Approval decision audit)]
  HUMAN --> FEEDBACK[(Separate human feedback records)]
  FEEDBACK -. curated offline training .-> MODEL[Future model version]

  DENIED --> RUNDB[(SQLite run and trace ledger)]
  FAILED --> RUNDB
  ALLOWED --> RUNDB
  APPROVAL --> RUNDB
